---
import Icon from '@/components/shared/Icon.astro';
import {pathTo} from '@/lib/paths';
---
<section class="section specialties" aria-labelledby="specialty-title"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-heading centered"><p class="eyebrow">CARE THAT WORKS TOGETHER</p><h2 id="specialty-title">When you need the <span>next level of care.</span></h2><p>OCA brings pain management, orthopedic, and spine expertise into one coordinated conversation, with treatment options tailored to your needs.</p></div>
  <div class="care-grid">
    <a class="care-card care-interventional" href={pathTo('/services/pain-management/')}><div class="care-card-head"><h3>Interventional<br/>Care</h3><span class="care-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="care-icon"><Icon name="spine" size={72} strokeWidth={1.3}/></div><p>Targeted procedures designed to address specific sources of pain when conservative approaches alone are not enough.</p><span class="care-link">Explore pain care <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
    <a class="care-card care-orthopedic" href={pathTo('/services/orthopedic-care/')}><div class="care-card-head"><h3>Orthopedic<br/>Care</h3><span class="care-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="care-icon"><Icon name="bone" size={72} strokeWidth={1.3}/></div><p>Comprehensive assessment and treatment for joint and musculoskeletal conditions, including surgical care when indicated.</p><span class="care-link">Explore orthopedic care <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
  </div>
  <a class="text-link centered-link" href={pathTo('/services/spine-care/')}>Learn about our spine care approach <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</div></section>
